# Copy to .env and fill in. Never commit .env — it is git-ignored.
#
# mcgyvr reads credentials from the environment, never from its config file;
# the config records only the NAME of the variable holding each key. Keys are
# held by the orchestrator process and are never passed into a task sandbox.
#
# All of these are OPTIONAL. With none set, mcgyvr runs local-only: the
# deterministic tool tier and local model workers, with the acceptance gate
# as the acceptance bar.

# API provider keys — the variable names here must match those referenced in
# your mcgyvr config.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=

# Forge token used to push a branch and open a pull request. Falls back to
# the ambient `gh` CLI credentials when unset.
# GITHUB_TOKEN=
